  ('ai:ai-batch-02:6dbc350e99af','A2'::public.cefr_level,'reading','Where did Rebin''s family stay in Duhok?',array['in a tent','with Karim','in a small hotel','at his grandmother''s house']::text[],'C','''We stayed in a small hotel near the dam.''',array['reading']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-02','Hi Karim,
